CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785808066
OL,3,CPc Harper's mother says family 'will
OL,4,Cpay the price' for early release scheme
OL,6,FThe proposals have sparked criticism
OL,7,Fafter it emerged two of Pc Harper's
OL,8,Fkillers would still qualify for early
OL,9,Frelease.
OL,11,FThe 28-year-old police officer
OL,12,Fsustained fatal injuries while
OL,13,Fresponding to a quad bike theft in
OL,14,FSulhamstead, Berkshire, in August 2019.
OL,16,FSpeaking to BBC Newsnight, his mother
OL,17,FDebbie Adlam said: "It feels like
OL,18,Fwe're letting Andrew down again. We've
OL,19,Fbeen through the justice system, we
OL,20,Fthought we'd done as best as we could.
OL,26,@yD@TOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785808066
OL,3,CPc Harper's mother says family 'will
OL,4,Cpay the price' for early release scheme
OL,6,F"Now we're standing up to fight again
OL,7,Fwith this evening's announcement, so I
OL,8,Fjust feel really let down, for
OL,9,FAndrew's sake as well as ours."
OL,11,FPc Harper died after getting caught in
OL,12,Fa strap attached to the back of a car
OL,13,Fand dragged down a country road as
OL,14,Fthree teenage suspects fled the scene
OL,15,Fof the burglary.
OL,17,FThe driver of the vehicle, Henry Long,
OL,18,Freceived a 16-year sentence and would
OL,19,Fnot have been eligible for the
OL,20,FGovernment's scheme.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785808066
OL,3,CPc Harper's mother says family 'will
OL,4,Cpay the price' for early release scheme
OL,6,FJessie Cole and Albert Bowers, who
OL,7,Fwere passengers in the car and
OL,8,Fsentenced to 13 years for manslaughter
OL,9,Fafter a trial at the Old Bailey in
OL,10,F2020, would become eligible for
OL,11,Frelease after serving half of their
OL,12,Fsentences.
OL,14,FMs Adlam confirmed Justice Secretary
OL,15,FAlex Norris had called her to explain
OL,16,Fthe situation.
OL,18,F"Apparently, the situation is, if
OL,19,Fnothing was done, then the prison
OL,20,Fsystem would fall completely," she
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,26,@zD@AOU|D@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785808066
OL,3,CPc Harper's mother says family 'will
OL,4,Cpay the price' for early release scheme
OL,6,F"But we're paying the price for it.
OL,7,FIt's Andrew and his family, and many
OL,8,Fothers like us, we're paying the
OL,9,Fprice."
OL,11,FAsked if she accepted Mr Norris's
OL,12,Fapology, Ms Adlam said: "I do know
OL,13,Fthat he was sorry, but there surely
OL,14,Fhas to be other answers, other ways to
OL,15,Flook at and other things to explore.
OL,16,FThis decision was made very quickly."
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@GO]tD@YOUxD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785808066
OL,3,CPc Harper's mother says family 'will
OL,4,Cpay the price' for early release scheme
OL,6,FThames Valley Police Chief Constable
OL,7,FJason Hogg said: "I am beyond
OL,8,Fdisappointed the Government is
OL,9,Fcontinuing to allow PC Andrew Harper's
OL,10,Fkillers to be released early from
OL,11,Fprison despite the overwhelming recent
OL,12,Fpublic outcry.
OL,14,F"It is simple: if Andrew's killers
OL,15,Fwere convicted today, they would
OL,16,Freceive life sentences due to the law
OL,17,Fthat was created in his name. They
OL,18,Fwould not be eligible for early
OL,19,Frelease.
OL,26,@oD@ROUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785808066
OL,3,CPc Harper's mother says family 'will
OL,4,Cpay the price' for early release scheme
OL,6,F"This decision is demoralising for all
OL,7,Fpolice officers and our fellow
OL,8,Femergency service workers, not just in
OL,9,Fthe Thames Valley, that puts
OL,10,Fthemselves in harm's way to protect
OL,11,Fand serve their community."
OL,13,FMr Burnham paused plans to release
OL,14,Fprisoners early in September to ease
OL,15,Fovercrowding in jails as part of the
OL,16,FSentencing Act.
OL,18,FThe scheme will now be delayed until
OL,19,FOctober.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30208
