CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785808066
OL,3,CPc Harper's mother says family 'will
OL,4,Cpay the price' for early release scheme
OL,6,FThe Prime Minister assured the public
OL,7,Fthat offenders will face tighter
OL,8,Fcommunity supervision, including new
OL,9,FGPS monitoring for rapists to restrict
OL,10,Ftheir movements.
OL,12,FMr Burnham said he "wanted to go even
OL,13,Ffurther", but that was not possible
OL,14,Fwithout the prison system collapsing
OL,15,Fand putting the public "at much
OL,16,Fgreater risk".
OL,18,FAnnouncing the changes, the Prime
OL,19,FMinister said: "We will also be
OL,20,Fintroducing much tougher community
OL,21,Fmeasures.
OL,26,@tD@TOUuD@HO]wD@XOUxD@MO]{D@POU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785808066
OL,3,CPc Harper's mother says family 'will
OL,4,Cpay the price' for early release scheme
OL,6,F"There will be a presumption that all
OL,7,Foffenders are tagged, longer periods
OL,8,Fof supervision and tough new rules,
OL,9,Fincluding restriction zones for
OL,10,Foffenders."
OL,12,FEarlier, Pc Harper's widow Lissie
OL,13,FHarper said releasing killers early
OL,14,Fwould be "an affront to justice" and
OL,15,F"an utter betrayal".
OL,17,FShe added: "The level of disrespect
OL,18,Fthe Government are showing to Andrew
OL,19,Fand other victims ` and to their loved
OL,20,Fones such as me ` is beyond contempt."
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@KO]vD@JOUvD@`O]wD@AOUwD@SO]yD@
